    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mark Maceluch",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104848410476171130105/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWmbjJlB3vojk6_HKmMm4t1AzPYgAxBsajrQcg-N3z6pnDStXH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Submarines are really good and you have 2 options for the submarine bread, either tasty sub rolls or for a bit extra pizza dough.  I had a #8 \"Le Super Special George\" sub withSteak, Pepperoni Roma, Mushrooms,  Green Peppers, and Capicollo.  Just awesome.  You can ask for sauces, by default they will bring you Italian dressing.  I highly recommend trying them out.  Service was very good by Cynthia and big thanks to chef.",
        "time": 1764268271,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dan Lauzon",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114455884734504923301/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK7Ph7um6rz_aaMkKME7MCLM9pDgGI_M4b81cKijTGjGaIyWQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "The best subs around - it's not even close!!\nGood and fast delivery, but when you eat one of these right outta the oven and it will be a glorious habit you look forward to!\nPro tip - if you like spicy bring your own hot sauce, the Franks for me doesn't bring the heat",
        "time": 1765908340,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Judy Hung",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108337021180260241258/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXlkhFi0xIrlxozKypsBluMXtnhPJ1bw9nrUa90vWN2n-9yBjKJgw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba8",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "We ordered the family special with our choices of half Royale & half meatball pizza; both flavours were excellent! The poutine was yummy with generous cheese. We also enjoyed the churro dessert; it’s like the Italian version of fried banana! Nice owner and friendly service; highly recommended!",
        "time": 1542418372,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Daniel Lu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103743904454766945558/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXhmb_0HJYhfeNRHehU51PV5-LubEqU151XkFif9p6PsAU2f6Co=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Best PIZZA on the planet AAA+++\n\nThe owner is great too!\n\nI EXTREMELY recomnd this location.\n\nFrom DanTheMan.\n\nUpdate( 11-Oct, 2024):\nStill  the bestEST Pizza in the whole planet!! The spicy sauce is to die for and the piirrii pirri one is dope too! Owners are phenomenally kind!!!\n\nPortion size is MEGA generous! Cheese is flavourful, lots of it and covered of soft salami  everywhere!!!\n\n(20-August,2025)\nStill the best Pizza in the planet!!\n(Anyone who says otherwise doesn't know what they are talking about!!)\n\nThe owners are so generous&kind!\n\nTheir Pizza is art!! Tasty, massive, and they don't cheap on materials!!!\n\nWorthes every dollar!!\n\nAAAAAAA++++\n\nORFER HERE ONLY!!!!",
        "time": 1755726563,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tim Onyszchuk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110593707411833733639/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXg5faeNEhdPW87bZaM092bRbtcH9nXdMU1Nb7c-DbR8gK6cGQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Such excellent subs!  The go-to place when a craving hits.  Definitely recommend and will be going back, have to try some of the other items on the menu.  Love it!",
        "time": 1758287888,
        "translated": false
      }
